{"articleNo":"444534","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=444534&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] [(재)대구문화예술진흥원] 명인명장 초청 대구관광기념품 원데이 클래스 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2023.06.19","hit":"2649","attachments":[{"name":"1_국문포스터.png","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=444534&attachNo=124794"},{"name":"2_영문포스터.png","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=444534&attachNo=124795"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">재</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">대구문화예술진흥원에서는 국내외 관광객 대상 대구관광홍보를 위해</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">‘</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">명인명장 초청 대구관광기념품 원데이 클래스</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">’</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">를 개최하오니</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">관심있는 분들의 많은 참여 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; 가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">행 사 명 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">명인명장 초청 대구관광기념품 원데이클래스</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; 나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">모집기간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">: 2023</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">월 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">~ 10</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">월</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; 다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">모집대상 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">국내외 관광객 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">회당 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">20</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">명씩</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">선착순 모집</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; 라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">수업내용 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">자개연필꽂이</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">모시모빌</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">전통연 만들기 등</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; 마</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">수업일정 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">: 7</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">, 10</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">월 매주 주말</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">토일반</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;1</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">일 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">회 수업진행 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">상세시간은 첨부한 홍보포스터 참고</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; 바</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">문 의 처 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">대구관광기념품 원데이클래스 운영사무국</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(053-721-7256)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">붙임 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">온라인 포스터</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">국문 및 영문</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">각 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;\">부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\"><br></span></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"10451\"><!--[data-hwpjson]{\n\"documentPr\": {\n\"di\": \"\",\n\"dp\": {\n\"dn\": \"test.hwp\",\n\"ta\": 1,\n\"d1\": 5,\n\"d2\": 0,\n\"dv\": 5,\n\"dr\": 1,\n\"do\": 1,\n\"vj\": \"1.0\",\n\"an\": \"Hancom Office Hangul\",\n\"av\": \"9, 1, 1, 5656\",\n\"ao\": \"WIN\",\n\"ab\": \"32\",\n\"ar\": \"LE\",\n\"as\": \"Windows_Unknown_Version\"\n},\n\"dis\": false,\n\"ds\": {\n\"ti\": \"\",\n\"la\": \"ko\",\n\"cr\": \"\",\n\"su\": \"\",\n\"de\": \"\",\n\"cd\": \"2023-06-19T17:37:05.001Z\",\n\"md\": \"1601-01-01T09:00:00.000Z\",\n\"pd\": \"1601-01-01T09:00:00.000Z\",\n\"ke\": \"\"\n}\n},\n\"dh\": {\n\"do\": {\n\"pa\": 1,\n\"fo\": 1,\n\"en\": 1,\n\"pi\": 1,\n\"tb\": 1,\n\"eq\": 1\n},\n\"fo\": [ ],\n\"cd\": {\n\"tp\": 0,\n\"lc\": {\n\"af\": false,\n\"ui\": false,\n\"fu\": false,\n\"dn\": false,\n\"ul\": false,\n\"el\":